{"5186030":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"SLAM TANK","steam_appid":5186030,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/a5bb213d7508120be4a2f89976463bfe.webp?t=1793322765\" width=780 height=45 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/339f64e157a6ebe361a292ebdfaaef3d.poster.avif?t=1793322765\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/339f64e157a6ebe361a292ebdfaaef3d.webm?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/339f64e157a6ebe361a292ebdfaaef3d.mp4?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An AI has taken control of the world’s machines. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three tanks, each with a distinct combat style, and fight to reclaim the world. <br>Spin the turret, swing your cannon barrel, and ram straight through enemy ranks. <br>Chain drifts, attacks, and unique abilities to tear through enemy hordes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/4b34b51eee5246f0176e541156b04e88.webp?t=1793322765\" width=780 height=45 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/0c27ff03b087a7d8a7f0709a4c230ee7.poster.avif?t=1793322765\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/0c27ff03b087a7d8a7f0709a4c230ee7.webm?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/0c27ff03b087a7d8a7f0709a4c230ee7.mp4?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive industrial machines block your path. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge their attacks, close the gap, and chain barrel strikes with powerful abilities to fight back.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/08d228a5fca2771307667fc735ad6ee0.webp?t=1793322765\" width=780 height=45 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/5763d5cf5cb28a4788acf8d5eb41d471.poster.avif?t=1793322765\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/5763d5cf5cb28a4788acf8d5eb41d471.webm?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/5763d5cf5cb28a4788acf8d5eb41d471.mp4?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit boost pads to pick up speed, then launch off jump ramps. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across the battlefield, chaining drifts and mid-air tricks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/83cbe84575097fb3a9e74bec0479cb46.webp?t=1793322765\" width=780 height=45 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/26d64aad0fbb879f5e6df0d653262ac3.poster.avif?t=1793322765\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/26d64aad0fbb879f5e6df0d653262ac3.webm?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/26d64aad0fbb879f5e6df0d653262ac3.mp4?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash machines - and the CPUs and GPUs inside them. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score is the total cost of the damage you deal to the AI’s machines. <br>Wreck more and beat your personal best.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/c5d274348375ad2146b3694c57f183f0.webp?t=1793322765\" width=780 height=45 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/14c2a48a65e276733093d46d0ff7f51b.poster.avif?t=1793322765\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/14c2a48a65e276733093d46d0ff7f51b.webm?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/14c2a48a65e276733093d46d0ff7f51b.mp4?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place decals and cosmetic parts wherever you like, then take your custom tank into battle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individuals and organizations may freely stream or post videos of any part of the SLAM TANK demo and use platform monetization features, with no need to contact us in advance.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/a5bb213d7508120be4a2f89976463bfe.webp?t=1793322765\" width=780 height=45 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/339f64e157a6ebe361a292ebdfaaef3d.poster.avif?t=1793322765\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/339f64e157a6ebe361a292ebdfaaef3d.webm?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/339f64e157a6ebe361a292ebdfaaef3d.mp4?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An AI has taken control of the world’s machines. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three tanks, each with a distinct combat style, and fight to reclaim the world. <br>Spin the turret, swing your cannon barrel, and ram straight through enemy ranks. <br>Chain drifts, attacks, and unique abilities to tear through