\/5186030\/extras\/5763d5cf5cb28a4788acf8d5eb41d471.webm?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/5763d5cf5cb28a4788acf8d5eb41d471.mp4?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit boost pads to pick up speed, then launch off jump ramps. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across the battlefield, chaining drifts and mid-air tricks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/83cbe84575097fb3a9e74bec0479cb46.webp?t=1793322765\" width=780 height=45 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/26d64aad0fbb879f5e6df0d653262ac3.poster.avif?t=1793322765\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/26d64aad0fbb879f5e6df0d653262ac3.webm?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5186030\/extras\/26d64aad0fbb879f5e6df0d653262ac3.mp4?t=1793322765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash machines - and the CPUs and GPUs inside them. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score is the total cost of the damage you deal to the AI’s machines. <br>Wreck more and beat your personal best.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_asse